#. ja: アイスクリーム頭痛
#. de: Eiskalte Killer
#. fr: De la glace à piler<nbsp>!
#. column 1: The change in climate experienced by Coerthas after the fall of Dalamud has done more than freeze rivers and prevent the growth of foliage─it has made the region more hospitable for a myriad of terrible creatures normally only found dwelling atop the highest of mountains─creatures that have proven naught but headaches for the residents of the western highlands.
msgctxt "Fate:908:0:0"
msgid "Sphenopalatine Ganglioneuralgia"
msgstr "Головная боль от мороженого"

#. ja: クルザス西部高地の寒冷化を加速させる<br>魔物の存在が、住民の頭痛の種となっている<br>アイススプライトとソルベを倒せ
#. de: In Coerthas ist es seit der Siebten Katastrophe kalt genug. Da können die Bewohner auf Monster, die die Temperaturen weiter in den Keller treiben, getrost verzichten. Vertreibe die lästigen Sorbets und Eis-Exergone.
#. fr: Les élémentaires de glace et les sorbets ont jeté un sacré froid dans les Hautes terres du Coerthas occidental. Ils réservent un accueil des plus frileux aux malheureux qui s'aventurent sur ce qu'ils pensent être leur territoire. Il ne tient qu'à vous de leur montrer de quel bois vous vous chauffez<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Sphenopalatine Ganglioneuralgia
msgctxt "Fate:908:0:1"
msgid "The change in climate experienced by Coerthas after the fall of Dalamud has done more than freeze rivers and prevent the growth of foliage─it has made the region more hospitable for a myriad of terrible creatures normally only found dwelling atop the highest of mountains─creatures that have proven naught but headaches for the residents of the western highlands."
msgstr "После падения Даламуда климат в Коэртаса изменился: реки замёрзли, растения перестали расти, а в крае расплодились ужасные твари, прежде обитавшие лишь на вершинах высочайших гор. Для жителей западных нагорий они стали настоящей головной болью."

#. ja: 冷酷なる氷竜「スティヒ」
#. de: Der Erzfeind der Vollstrecker
#. fr: Défi<nbsp>: Stihi, c'est fini<nbsp>!
#. column 1: There are very few dragons the Convictors do not dream of slaying─the cold and calculating Stihi being no exception. The knights, however, while skilled at dreaming, have been less than successful at actually subduing the creature...
msgctxt "Fate:909:0:0"
msgid "A Stihi Situation"
msgstr "Со Стихи не соскучишься"

#. ja: 聖フィネア連隊の騎兵たちが狙ってやまない<br>大物のドラゴン族が、西部高地に飛来した<br>冷酷なる氷竜、スティヒを倒せ
#. de: Der mächtige Eisdrache Stihi, an dem sich Finneas Vollstrecker bisher die Zähne ausgebissen haben, ist im westlichen Hochland gelandet. Beschere ihm eine ewige Eiszeit.
#. fr: Les chevaliers du Convictoire ont beau le traquer jour et nuit, Stihi finit toujours par revenir dans les Hautes terres du Coerthas occidental. Pas question de le laisser plus longtemps souffler le frais et le froid dans la région. Occupez-vous de son cas<nbsp>!
#. column 0: A Stihi Situation
msgctxt "Fate:909:0:1"
msgid "There are very few dragons the Convictors do not dream of slaying─the cold and calculating Stihi being no exception. The knights, however, while skilled at dreaming, have been less than successful at actually subduing the creature..."
msgstr "Есть лишь несколько драконов, которых не мечтают убить Конвикторы, и холодный расчётливый Стихи — не исключение. Правда, рыцари умеют мечтать куда лучше, чем одолевать этого дракона..."

#. ja: 変貌せし乙女「ドラゴンメイデン」
#. de: Drachenmaid, hast du heut für mich Zeit
#. fr: Défi<nbsp>: la vierge marrie
#. column 1: Once a beautiful young Elezen with skin like snow and hair like an autumn sun, the dragon maiden was driven to sip the blood of the Horde after being set upon by a pair of highborn knights (who were subsequently tried and hung for their crimes). Since then, she has grown into one of the most ruthless of all wyrm-blooded heretics, attacking even innocent children. Deliver the maiden from this world and give her soul peace once again.
msgctxt "Fate:910:0:0"
msgid "Ware the Maiden Fair"
msgstr "Остерегайтесь девы"

#. ja: 竜の血を飲み干して変貌を遂げた<br>大物異端者が、不浄の集落にて発見された<br>変貌せし乙女、ドラゴンメイデンを倒せ
#. de: Die Drachenmaid war einst eine wunderschöne Elezen, bis abtrünnige Ritter ihr Drachenblut verabreichten - ein Frevel, für den sie mit dem Strick bestraft wurden. Ihrem Opfer half das selbstreden nicht. Mit den Jahren verrohte sie immer mehr, nun kennt ihr Herz nur noch Hass.
#. fr: Une hérétique a bu le sang d'un dragon et a pris la fuite avant de se transformer, mais il s'agit cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment de la vierge dragon qui s'est récemment installée à Annexe Mineure. Réglez-lui son compte au plus vite.
#. column 0: Ware the Maiden Fair
msgctxt "Fate:910:0:1"
msgid "Once a beautiful young Elezen with skin like snow and hair like an autumn sun, the dragon maiden was driven to sip the blood of the Horde after being set upon by a pair of highborn knights (who were subsequently tried and hung for their crimes). Since then, she has grown into one of the most ruthless of all wyrm-blooded heretics, attacking even innocent children. Deliver the maiden from this world and give her soul peace once again."
msgstr "Прежде прекрасная юная элезенка с кожей белой, как снег, и волосами цвета осеннего солнца, дева-дракон испила крови Орды после того, как на неё напали двое знатных рыцарей. За это преступление их судили и повесили. С тех пор она стала одной из самых беспощадных еретичек, испивших драконьей крови, и нападает даже на невинных детей. Избавьте этот мир от девы и верните покой её душе."

#. ja: バグフィックス
#. de: Wiederkehrende Bugs
#. fr: Corriger les bugs
#. column 1: A swarm of mechanical monstrosities is wreaking havoc on the environs of Thanalan. Stand together with the wandering minstrel, and eradicate this skittering threat.
msgctxt "Fate:911:0:0"
msgid "Recurring Bugs"
msgstr "Баги возвращаются"

#. ja: 機械仕掛けの魔物が大量発生し<br>エオルゼアの土地を、侵食し始めている<br>異邦の詩人と共に、バグを倒せ
#. de: Eine explodierende Zahl mechanischer Schädlinge hat sich in Thanalan zu einer wahren Landplage entwickelt. Steh dem Fahrenden Sänger zu Seite, um die Flut einzudämmen.
#. fr: Des nuées d'insectes mécaniques s'abattent sans discontinuer sur le Thanalan et mettent en péril les festivités de la Commémoration. Combattez aux côtés du ménestrel errant pour éradiquer ces créatures et permettre aux Éorzéens de fêter dignement la renaissance de leur terre<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Recurring Bugs
msgctxt "Fate:911:0:1"
msgid "A swarm of mechanical monstrosities is wreaking havoc on the environs of Thanalan. Stand together with the wandering minstrel, and eradicate this skittering threat."
msgstr "Рой механических чудовищ разоряет окрестности Таналана. Встаньте плечом к плечу со Странствующим менестрелем и уничтожьте эту шуструю угрозу."

#. ja: バグフィックス
#. de: Wiederkehrende Bugs
#. fr: Corriger les bugs
#. column 1: A swarm of mechanical monstrosities is wreaking havoc on the environs of Thanalan. Stand together with the wandering minstrel, and eradicate this skittering threat.
msgctxt "Fate:912:0:0"
msgid "Recurring Bugs"
msgstr "Баги возвращаются"

#. ja: 機械仕掛けの魔物が大量発生し<br>エオルゼアの土地を、侵食し始めている<br>異邦の詩人と共に、バグを倒せ
#. de: Eine explodierende Zahl mechanischer Schädlinge hat sich in Thanalan zu einer wahren Landplage entwickelt. Steh dem Fahrenden Sänger zu Seite, um die Flut einzudämmen.
#. fr: Des nuées d'insectes mécaniques s'abattent sans discontinuer sur le Thanalan et mettent en péril les festivités de la Commémoration. Combattez aux côtés du ménestrel errant pour éradiquer ces créatures et permettre aux Éorzéens de fêter dignement la renaissance de leur terre<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Recurring Bugs
msgctxt "Fate:912:0:1"
msgid "A swarm of mechanical monstrosities is wreaking havoc on the environs of Thanalan. Stand together with the wandering minstrel, and eradicate this skittering threat."
msgstr "Рой механических чудовищ разоряет окрестности Таналана. Встаньте плечом к плечу со Странствующим менестрелем и уничтожьте эту шуструю угрозу."

#. ja: 紅蓮祭「良俗の守護者」
#. de: Eins, zwei, Sittenpolizei
#. fr: Défi<nbsp>: le regard froid du Mamool Ja
#. column 1: Faires attract all sorts, and one Mamool Ja has been so incensed by the sights and sounds that he insists on showing the dance of his people, which would make even the most ribald pirate blush. Drive the overeager Mamool Ja away and protect the sensibilities of the beach's faire-goers.
msgctxt "Fate:913:0:0"
msgid "The Sarong Song"
msgstr "Песня о саронге"

#. ja: 卑猥な踊りを紅蓮祭で披露しようと<br>マムージャ族の傭兵がやって来た<br>美男のブガージャを退け、風紀を守れ
#. de: Ein Krieger der Mamool Ja ist aufgekreuzt, um den friedlichen Feuermond-Reigen mit obszönen Tänzen zu stören. Verjage den schamlosen Bugaal Ja!
#. fr: Les feux de la Mort ont attiré Bugaal Ja et il n'a qu'une envie<nbsp>: faire une dé<shy>mon<shy>stra<shy>tion de danse à Costa del Sol. Ses pas font monter la température, mais certains visiteurs ont dit que c'était nul et que ça craignait. Envoyez-le promener<nbsp>! Des soirées sauvages l'attendent sans doute ailleurs.
#. column 0: The Sarong Song
msgctxt "Fate:913:0:1"
msgid "Faires attract all sorts, and one Mamool Ja has been so incensed by the sights and sounds that he insists on showing the dance of his people, which would make even the most ribald pirate blush. Drive the overeager Mamool Ja away and protect the sensibilities of the beach's faire-goers. "
msgstr "На праздники собирается всякий люд. Один мамул-джа так возмутился увиденным и услышанным, что решил показать танец своего народа. От такого даже самый развязный пират покраснеет! Прогоните ретивого мамул-джа и не дайте ему смутить гостей пляжного праздника."

#. ja: 紅蓮祭「一夏の熱狂」
#. de: Verrückt nach dir
#. fr: Ce n'est qu'un amour de vacances
#. column 1: Pirates often spend moons surrounded by nothing but frigid seawater, and the appearance of this lovely courtesan has set their hearts aflame with passion. Quell the surging tide of unwanted attention so she can enjoy her vacation in peace.
msgctxt "Fate:914:0:0"
msgid "The Belle of the Beach"
msgstr "Красавица пляжа"

#. ja: 常夏の踊り娘の扇情的な色香が<br>海賊たちの心に火をつけてしまった<br>熱狂する海賊たちを鎮めろ
#. de: Eine beliebte Kurtisane wird von einer Piratenbande bedrängt. Sorge dafür, dass die Dame den Feuermond-Reigen genießen kann und bring den aufdringlichen Seeräubern Manieren bei.
#. fr: L'ambiance est torride pendant les Feux de la Mort. Les poses lascives de la danseuse court vêtue ont donné chaud aux pirates. Calmez-les avant qu'ils ne cherchent à l'approcher. Ils doivent comprendre que cette histoire est sans lendemain.
#. column 0: The Belle of the Beach
msgctxt "Fate:914:0:1"
msgid "Pirates often spend moons surrounded by nothing but frigid seawater, and the appearance of this lovely courtesan has set their hearts aflame with passion. Quell the surging tide of unwanted attention so she can enjoy her vacation in peace."
msgstr "Пираты месяцами плавают среди ледяных вод, и появление прекрасной куртизанки зажгло в их сердцах страсть. Утихомирьте волну нежелательного внимания, чтобы она могла спокойно отдохнуть."

#. ja: 紅蓮祭「危険な火遊び」
#. de: Zündeln verboten
#. fr: Jouer avec le feu
#. column 1: A group of pirates have decided to celebrate their own way by bringing a cart filled with fireworks of suspect quality to the beach. Drive them away before their explosives harm any innocent faire-goers.
msgctxt "Fate:915:0:0"
msgid "Sparking Up the Wrong Beach"
msgstr "Не тот пляж для фейерверков"

#. ja: 危険なお手製花火を持ち込み<br>紅蓮祭を妨害しようとする海賊を退けろ<br>不作法な海賊たちを倒せ
#. de: Eine Bande leichtsinniger Piraten zündelt am Strand mit selbstgemachtem Feuerwerk und bringt damit die Besucher des Feuermond-Reigens in Gefahr.
#. fr: Les feux d'artifice faits maison sont interdits à Costa del Sol pendant toute la durée des Feux de la Mort. C'est beaucoup trop dangereux... Occupez-vous de ces pirates qui ont décidé de ne pas obéir au règlement<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Sparking Up the Wrong Beach
msgctxt "Fate:915:0:1"
msgid "A group of pirates have decided to celebrate their own way by bringing a cart filled with fireworks of suspect quality to the beach. Drive them away before their explosives harm any innocent faire-goers. "
msgstr "Группа пиратов решила отметить праздник по-своему и привезла на пляж телегу сомнительных фейерверков. Прогоните их, пока взрывчатка не покалечила невинных гостей праздника."

#. ja: 紅蓮祭「海獣の調教師」
#. de: Seeungeheuer bitte anleinen
#. fr: Défi<nbsp>: dressé contre son maître
#. column 1: Certain beasts, when properly trained, can provide endless entertainment to spectators, but when they start running amok─as this one has─they must needs be put down. Slay the trained Thing from the Deep before it harms any innocent onlookers.
msgctxt "Fate:916:0:0"
msgid "It Came from Beneath the Deep"
msgstr "Вышел он из морской пучины"

#. ja: 紅蓮祭の見世物として用意された海獣が<br>獣牧士を振り払い、暴れ始めた<br>トレインド・モーガウルを倒せ
#. de: Eine besondere Attraktion des Feuermond-Reigens hat sich losgerissen und macht den Strand unsicher. Mache den entlaufenen Morgawr kampfunfähig, bevor er noch jemanden verletzt.
#. fr: Le monstre marin qu'un dresseur avait emmené à Costa del Sol pour épater la galerie a échappé au contrôle de son maître. Voilà qu'il sème la terreur parmi les visiteurs venus profiter des Feux de la Mort. Réglez son compte au Morgawr dressé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: It Came from Beneath the Deep
msgctxt "Fate:916:0:1"
msgid "Certain beasts, when properly trained, can provide endless entertainment to spectators, but when they start running amok─as this one has─they must needs be put down. Slay the trained Thing from the Deep before it harms any innocent onlookers."
msgstr "Правильно обученные звери могут бесконечно развлекать зрителей. Но если они начинают буйствовать — как этот, — их приходится усмирять силой. Убейте дрессированного морского монстра, пока он не навредил зевакам."

#. ja: 紅蓮祭「軟派者の末路」
#. de: Badelust, Badefrust
#. fr: Dragueurs de bac à sable
#. column 1: Two faire-goers wishing to enjoy the fireworks in peace are being accosted by a group of insistent pirates. Teach the pirates to respect the wishes of others, and be prepared if they decide not to listen.
#. column 3: Youths
msgctxt "Fate:917:0:0"
msgid "Life's a Beach"
msgstr "Пляжная жизнь"

#. ja: 紅蓮祭を楽しむために訪れた少女たちが<br>海賊たちに言い寄られ、迷惑している<br>少女を守り、海賊たちを撃退せよ
#. de: Badelustige Besucherinnen des Feuermond-Reigens werden von aufdringlichen Seeräubern belästigt. Beschütze die unschuldigen Badenixen!
#. fr: Les Feux de la Mort ont attiré des goujats qui ont pris des festivalières à part et refusent de les laisser partir. Aidez ces jeunes à leur apprendre les bonnes manières et faites en sorte qu'elles s'en sortent saines et sauves<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Life's a Beach
#. column 3: Youths
msgctxt "Fate:917:0:1"
msgid "Two faire-goers wishing to enjoy the fireworks in peace are being accosted by a group of insistent pirates. Teach the pirates to respect the wishes of others, and be prepared if they decide not to listen."
msgstr "Двум гостям праздника, которые хотели спокойно посмотреть на фейерверки, не дают прохода настойчивые пираты. Научите наглецов уважать чужое желание и будьте готовы, если они не поймут с первого раза."

#. ja: 少女の数
#. de: Badenixen
#. fr: Nombre de jeunes filles
#. column 0: Life's a Beach
#. column 1: Two faire-goers wishing to enjoy the fireworks in peace are being accosted by a group of insistent pirates. Teach the pirates to respect the wishes of others, and be prepared if they decide not to listen.
msgctxt "Fate:917:0:3"
msgid "Youths"
msgstr "Девушки"

#. ja: 紅蓮祭「海賊の密造酒」
#. de: Und ne Buddel voll Rum
#. fr: Des bouteilles à la mer
#. column 1: Pirates wishing to keep their own festivities going have brought a supply of liquor, causing a scene and littering the beach with bottles. Collect the bottles by force and pick up any you find on the ground to keep the pirates from causing any more trouble.
#. column 2: Bring bottles to the chaperone.
#. column 3: Bottles delivered
msgctxt "Fate:918:0:0"
msgid "Feeling Groggy"
msgstr "Пьяные дела"

#. ja: 海賊たちが密造酒を持ち込んで<br>好き勝手に酒盛りをしようとしている<br>「海賊の密造酒」を集めろ
#. de: Vergnügungssüchtige Piraten haben selbstgebrannten Rum an den Strand mitgebracht und die Flaschen überall liegen lassen. Sammle sie wieder ein, bevor der hochprozentige Fusel in die falschen Hände gerät.
#. fr: Les pirates ne sont pas arrivés seuls pour les Feux de la Mort. Ils sont venus accompagnés de leurs bouteilles de tord-boyaux maison, qu'ils abandonnent sur la plage une fois bues. Ramassez les bouteilles vides qui traînent par terre et remettez-les à l'organisateur avant que quelqu'un ne se blesse.
#. column 0: Feeling Groggy
#. column 2: Bring bottles to the chaperone.
#. column 3: Bottles delivered
msgctxt "Fate:918:0:1"
msgid "Pirates wishing to keep their own festivities going have brought a supply of liquor, causing a scene and littering the beach with bottles. Collect the bottles by force and pick up any you find on the ground to keep the pirates from causing any more trouble."
msgstr "Пираты, решившие продолжить собственное веселье, притащили на пляж выпивку и устроили шум, разбросав бутылки по всему берегу. Отберите у них алкоголь и соберите бутылки с песка, чтобы они не натворили ещё чего-нибудь."

#. ja: 押収した「海賊の密造酒」を<br>「紅蓮祭実行委員」に<br>速やかに納品せよ
#. de: Bring den Piratenfusel zu dem Strand-Kaskadeur.
#. fr: Continuez de remettre des bouteilles à l'organisateur des Feux de la Mort.
#. column 0: Feeling Groggy
#. column 1: Pirates wishing to keep their own festivities going have brought a supply of liquor, causing a scene and littering the beach with bottles. Collect the bottles by force and pick up any you find on the ground to keep the pirates from causing any more trouble.
#. column 3: Bottles delivered
msgctxt "Fate:918:0:2"
msgid "Bring bottles to the chaperone."
msgstr "Отнесите бутылки распорядителю праздника."

#. ja: 納品した海賊の密造酒の数
#. de: Eingesammelte Flaschen
#. fr: Bouteilles remises à l'organisateur
#. column 0: Feeling Groggy
#. column 1: Pirates wishing to keep their own festivities going have brought a supply of liquor, causing a scene and littering the beach with bottles. Collect the bottles by force and pick up any you find on the ground to keep the pirates from causing any more trouble.
#. column 2: Bring bottles to the chaperone.
msgctxt "Fate:918:0:3"
msgid "Bottles delivered"
msgstr "Сдано бутылок"

#. ja: 星唄異聞：あなたの為に
#. de: Räuber mit den Scherenhänden
#. fr: Crabes martyrs
#. column 1: To begin her training, Iroha would challenge the robber crabs of Costa del Sol. Fight by her side and see that she is not overwhelmed.
#. column 3: Iroha
msgctxt "Fate:932:0:0"
msgid "Our Favorite Pastime"
msgstr "Любимое занятие"

#. ja: 異邦の旅人イロハとともに<br>効率よく武者修行を為し遂げる為<br>浅瀬に集う魔物、ロバークラブを倒せ
#. de: Hilf Iroha dabei, ihre Kampfübungen zu absolvieren und die aggressiven Räuberkrabben zu erlegen!
#. fr: Aidez Iroha à progresser sur la voie du guerrier bushin en combattant des crabes voleurs à ses côtés.
#. column 0: Our Favorite Pastime
#. column 3: Iroha
msgctxt "Fate:932:0:1"
msgid "To begin her training, Iroha would challenge the robber crabs of Costa del Sol. Fight by her side and see that she is not overwhelmed."
msgstr "В начале тренировок Ироха решила сразиться с крабами-разбойниками на Коста-дель-Соль. Сражайтесь рядом с ней и не дайте ей увязнуть в бою."

#. ja: イロハ
#. de: Iroha
#. fr: Iroha
#. column 0: Our Favorite Pastime
#. column 1: To begin her training, Iroha would challenge the robber crabs of Costa del Sol. Fight by her side and see that she is not overwhelmed.
msgctxt "Fate:932:0:3"
msgid "Iroha"
msgstr "Ироха"

#. ja: 星唄異聞：偉大な侍の証
#. de: Der Weg des Samurai
#. fr: De l'excellence du samouraï
#. column 1: Iroha is surprised to find that the voidsent near Haukke Manor are reminiscent of demons from an old story she knows well. Join her in battle and help her to defeat the fiends.
#. column 3: Iroha
msgctxt "Fate:933:0:0"
msgid "The Way of the Samurai"
msgstr "Путь самурая"

#. ja: 武者修行に励む異邦の旅人<br>イロハとともに偉大な武人の証を立てよ<br>闇の眷属を率いる、ゴアデーモンを倒せ
#. de: Hilf Iroha dabei, ihre Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten zu stärken und die Horden der Blutdämonen zu bezwingen!
#. fr: Aidez Iroha à dépasser ses limites de samouraï en combattant la horde de démons maléfiques à ses côtés.
#. column 0: The Way of the Samurai
#. column 3: Iroha
msgctxt "Fate:933:0:1"
msgid "Iroha is surprised to find that the voidsent near Haukke Manor are reminiscent of demons from an old story she knows well. Join her in battle and help her to defeat the fiends."
msgstr "Ироха удивлена: бездны возле поместья Хаукке напоминают ей демонов из старинной сказки, которую она хорошо знает. Сражайтесь вместе с ней и помогите одолеть чудовищ."

#. ja: イロハ
#. de: Iroha
#. fr: Iroha
#. column 0: The Way of the Samurai
#. column 1: Iroha is surprised to find that the voidsent near Haukke Manor are reminiscent of demons from an old story she knows well. Join her in battle and help her to defeat the fiends.
msgctxt "Fate:933:0:3"
msgid "Iroha"
msgstr "Ироха"

#. ja: 星唄異聞：計り知れない強敵
#. de: Skorpione beißen nicht
#. fr: Un scorpion pas si pacifique
#. column 1: While investigating rumors of a sinister creature, Iroha finds herself face-to-face with Serket, a fearsome beast of legend. Join forces with Iroha and see if the monstrosity lives up to its reputation.
#. column 3: Iroha
msgctxt "Fate:934:0:0"
msgid "Serket Breaker"
msgstr "Поборитель Серкета"

#. ja: 異邦の旅人イロハとともに幻の魔獣に挑め<br>敵の悠然たる様は、強者の余裕か？<br>見事な連携で伝説の大蠍、セルケトを倒せ
#. de: Hilf Ihora, ihre Wanderschaft erfolgreich zu beenden und den legendären Serket zu besiegen!
#. fr: Assistez Iroha dans son combat pour venir à bout du légendaire scorpion géant Serket.
#. column 0: Serket Breaker
#. column 3: Iroha
msgctxt "Fate:934:0:1"
msgid "While investigating rumors of a sinister creature, Iroha finds herself face-to-face with Serket, a fearsome beast of legend. Join forces with Iroha and see if the monstrosity lives up to its reputation."
msgstr "Расследуя слухи о зловещем создании, Ироха столкнулась лицом к лицу с Серкетом — легендарным чудовищем, внушающим ужас. Объединитесь с Ирохой и проверьте, оправдывает ли зверь свою славу."

#. ja: イロハ
#. de: Iroha
#. fr: Iroha
#. column 0: Serket Breaker
#. column 1: While investigating rumors of a sinister creature, Iroha finds herself face-to-face with Serket, a fearsome beast of legend. Join forces with Iroha and see if the monstrosity lives up to its reputation.
msgctxt "Fate:934:0:3"
msgid "Iroha"
msgstr "Ироха"

#. ja: 星唄異聞：「鏡裏」の極意
#. de: Der Schlüssel zu Amatsu Kyori
#. fr: Le secret d'Amatsu<nbsp>: Kyôri
#. column 1: With her memories restored, the time has come for Iroha to wield Amatsu: Kyori in battle. Help her to defeat the dread dragon and its voidsent minion that she might harness the power within.
#. column 3: Iroha
msgctxt "Fate:935:0:0"
msgid "The Key to Amatsu: Kyori"
msgstr "Ключ к Амацу: Кёри"

#. ja: 異邦の旅人イロハが「天つ水影流・鏡裏」の<br>極意を会得すべく、最後の難敵に挑む<br>彼女とともに、スポッターとドレッドドラゴンを倒せ
#. de: Hilf Iroha, Amatsu Kyori zu meistern und den Ahriman-Wächter und den Albtraumdrachen zu bezwingen!
#. fr: Prêtez main-forte à Iroha dans la dernière épreuve qui la sépare du secret de la technique Amatsu<nbsp>: Kyôri en venant à bout du terrible dragon d'effroi et de son sbire, l'ahriman guetteur.
#. column 0: The Key to Amatsu: Kyori
#. column 3: Iroha
msgctxt "Fate:935:0:1"
msgid "With her memories restored, the time has come for Iroha to wield Amatsu: Kyori in battle. Help her to defeat the dread dragon and its voidsent minion that she might harness the power within."
msgstr "Память вернулась к Ирохе, и теперь пришло время применить Амацу: Кёри в бою. Помогите ей одолеть дракона ужаса и его прислужника из бездны, чтобы она овладела скрытой силой."

#. ja: イロハ
#. de: Iroha
#. fr: Iroha
#. column 0: The Key to Amatsu: Kyori
#. column 1: With her memories restored, the time has come for Iroha to wield Amatsu: Kyori in battle. Help her to defeat the dread dragon and its voidsent minion that she might harness the power within.
msgctxt "Fate:935:0:3"
msgid "Iroha"
msgstr "Ироха"

#. ja: 降神祭「モチモチ餅持ち逃げろ！」
#. de: Reis stampfen, Herzen erobern
#. fr: Le mochi, ça rend marteau<nbsp>!
#. column 1: There is no mochi as tasty as that pounded by the mallet of an overzealous cyclops. Nimble adventurers are needed to retrieve advent cakes from the Heavensturn mortar while avoiding any monkey mischief.
#. column 2: Deliver the advent cakes to Jiromaru.
#. column 3: Advent cakes delivered
msgctxt "Fate:936:0:0"
msgid "Pounding Rice, Pounding Hearts"
msgstr "Мочи в ступе — сердце в бегах"

#. ja: 興奮したサイクロプスが<br>臼を破壊せん勢いで餅をついている<br>猿の妨害を避け、モチモチ降神餅を回収せよ
#. de: Kaum ein Mochi ist so lecker wie ein von einem übereifrigen Zyklopen gestampftes. Flinke Abenteurer sind gefragt, um die Mochi-Klumpen aus dem Himmelswenden-Mörser zu klauben, während die Affen dort ihren Unfug treiben.
#. fr: Le cyclope a pris sa tâche très au sérieux et martèle le riz comme si sa vie en dépendait<nbsp>! Saisissez la bonne occasion pour récupérer des mochi de la transition, tout en repoussant les opo-opo qui tentent de vous en empêcher.
#. column 0: Pounding Rice, Pounding Hearts
#. column 2: Deliver the advent cakes to Jiromaru.
#. column 3: Advent cakes delivered
msgctxt "Fate:936:0:1"
msgid "There is no mochi as tasty as that pounded by the mallet of an overzealous cyclops. Nimble adventurers are needed to retrieve advent cakes from the Heavensturn mortar while avoiding any monkey mischief."
msgstr "Нет мочи вкуснее той, что растолкал в ступе разошедшийся циклоп. Ловким искателям приключений предстоит унести праздничные лепёшки из ступы Праздника Небесного свода и не попасться на проказы обезьян."

#. ja: 回収した「モチモチ降神餅」を<br>「ジロウマル」に<br>速やかに納品せよ
#. de: Liefere die Mochi-Klumpen bei Jiromaru ab.
#. fr: Une fois les mochi en votre possession, allez vite les apporter à Jirômaru.
#. column 0: Pounding Rice, Pounding Hearts
#. column 1: There is no mochi as tasty as that pounded by the mallet of an overzealous cyclops. Nimble adventurers are needed to retrieve advent cakes from the Heavensturn mortar while avoiding any monkey mischief.
#. column 3: Advent cakes delivered
msgctxt "Fate:936:0:2"
msgid "Deliver the advent cakes to Jiromaru."
msgstr "Отнесите праздничные лепёшки Дзиромару."

