#. ja: エッグハント「集めろ飾りタマゴ」
#. de: Fröhliche Eiersuche
#. fr: Chasse aux Prœufs
#. column 1: Seeking to recapture a lucid dream she had, Jihli Aliapoh has hidden Archon eggs throughout the quarter and employed her most restless spriggan to oversee a frivolous hunt. Snatch up as many as you can and deliver them to the spriggan before the hunt ends as abruptly as the dream did.
#. column 2: Deliver the Archon eggs to the Spriggan Eggstractor.
#. column 3: Archon eggs delivered
msgctxt "Fate:942:0:0"
msgid "Eggstract and Eggspedite"
msgstr "Яичная охота: собирай яйца!"

#. ja: エッグハントがやって来た<br>アルコンエッグを拾い集めて<br>スプリガン・エッグコレクターに届けろ
#. de: In dem Versuch, einen lebhaften Traum nachzustellen, hat Jihli Aliapoh zahlreiche Wundereier in Alt-Gridania versteckt und ihren treuesten Spriggan damit beauftragt, eine fröhliche Eiersuche zu betreuen. Sammle so viele Eier wie möglich, ehe die Suche so abrupt endet wie Jihlis Traum.
#. fr: Désirant recréer son rêve, Jihli Aliapoh a caché des Prœufs partout dans la cité. Ramassez-en autant que vous pouvez et livrez-les au spriggan avant que la partie de chasse ne se termine aussi brusquement que le rêve de la Miqo'te.
#. column 0: Eggstract and Eggspedite
#. column 2: Deliver the Archon eggs to the Spriggan Eggstractor.
#. column 3: Archon eggs delivered
msgctxt "Fate:942:0:1"
msgid "Seeking to recapture a lucid dream she had, Jihli Aliapoh has hidden Archon eggs throughout the quarter and employed her most restless spriggan to oversee a frivolous hunt. Snatch up as many as you can and deliver them to the spriggan before the hunt ends as abruptly as the dream did."
msgstr "Джили Алиапо хочет вновь пережить свой яркий сон и спрятала яйца Архонтов по всему кварталу, поручив самому неугомонному сприггану устроить весёлую охоту. Соберите как можно больше яиц и отнесите их сприггану, пока охота не закончилась так же внезапно, как сон."

#. ja: 手に入れたアルコンエッグを<br>スプリガン・エッグコレクターに<br>速やかに納品せよ
#. de: Liefere die Wundereier bei dem Spriggan-Eiersammler ab.
#. fr: Le spriggan en veut plus<nbsp>!<br>Continuez à lui donner des Prœufs<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Eggstract and Eggspedite
#. column 1: Seeking to recapture a lucid dream she had, Jihli Aliapoh has hidden Archon eggs throughout the quarter and employed her most restless spriggan to oversee a frivolous hunt. Snatch up as many as you can and deliver them to the spriggan before the hunt ends as abruptly as the dream did.
#. column 3: Archon eggs delivered
msgctxt "Fate:942:0:2"
msgid "Deliver the Archon eggs to the Spriggan Eggstractor."
msgstr "Отнесите яйца Архонтов сприггану-собирателю."

#. ja: 納品したアルコンエッグの数
#. de: Abgelieferte Wundereier
#. fr: Prœufs livrés
#. column 0: Eggstract and Eggspedite
#. column 1: Seeking to recapture a lucid dream she had, Jihli Aliapoh has hidden Archon eggs throughout the quarter and employed her most restless spriggan to oversee a frivolous hunt. Snatch up as many as you can and deliver them to the spriggan before the hunt ends as abruptly as the dream did.
#. column 2: Deliver the Archon eggs to the Spriggan Eggstractor.
