#. ja: 星呼の古代獣「ブラキオレイドス」
#. de: Geheimnis der verschollenen Legende
#. fr: Défi<nbsp>: brachiosaures en famille
#. column 1: Responding to the cries of her child, a mother brachiosaur has launched a merciless attack on a band of adventurers who entered the Diadem looking to capture a baby brachiosaur and return with it to Ishgard where they would auction it to the highest bidder.
msgctxt "Fate:968:0:0"
msgid "Secret of the Lost Legend"
msgstr "Тайна древней легенды"

#. ja: ブラキオレイドスの幼獣を狙った冒険者が<br>親獣に見つかって、逆襲に遭っている<br>星呼の古代獣、ブラキオレイドスを倒せ
#. de: Eine Gruppe von Abenteurern ist ins Diadem vorgedrungen, um einen Baby-Brachiosaurus zu fangen und in Ishgard an den Höchsbietenden zu versteigern. Die Mutter des Jungtieres hat jedoch dessen Schreie vernommen und greift nun gnadenlos an.
#. fr: Des aventuriers se sont mis en tête de chasser de jeunes brachiosaures, en dépit du fait que les parents ne sont jamais très loin de leur progéniture. Allez prêter main-forte à ces inconscients avant que l'instinct de protection de ces sauropodes ne leur soit fatal.
#. column 0: Secret of the Lost Legend
msgctxt "Fate:968:0:1"
msgid "Responding to the cries of her child, a mother brachiosaur has launched a merciless attack on a band of adventurers who entered the Diadem looking to capture a baby brachiosaur and return with it to Ishgard where they would auction it to the highest bidder. "
msgstr "На крики детёныша примчалась мать-брахиозавр и безжалостно набросилась на искателей приключений. Те пробрались в Диадему, чтобы поймать малыша и отвезти его в Ишгард, где собирались продать с аукциона тому, кто предложит больше."

#. ja: 放属性シャードの悪影響
#. de: Elementarer Wahnsinn
#. fr: Radiations néfastes
#. column 1: Aether emitted by unstable elemental crystals is sending even the most docile of creatures into uncontrollable fits of madness. The condition appears to be irreversible, with a swift end the only means of granting these poor souls mercy.
