#. de: Entschlossene Gehilfin
#. fr: Servant dévoué
#. column 0: Mad Ventures in Retainer-sitting
#. column 1: Not content with the paltry pickings his retainer was retrieving from ventures into the Black Shroud, a well-to-do noble recently ordered his humble hireling to the Diadem, forbidding the retainer's return until “treasure worthy of a king” was discovered. All the poor soul discovered, however, was a den of starving sky creatures, and now requires aid in escape.
